      "message": "feat(mermaid): create @floatboat/nexus-plugin-mermaid package\n\nExtract mermaid diagram rendering into a standalone plugin package,\nfollowing the same WidgetDefinition pattern as plugin-math.\n\n- Lazy-load mermaid.js (~500KB) only when a mermaid block is rendered\n- SVG cache keyed by source string avoids redundant renders\n- Hover-revealed edit button for entering edit mode (consistent with\n  plugin-math)\n- Error display with 'Edit source' link for invalid mermaid syntax\n- Orphan DOM cleanup in destroy() for mermaid-injected nodes\n- 7 test cases covering normal render, edit mode, non-mermaid blocks,\n  async loading, syntax errors, and lifecycle cleanup\n\nOpenSpec: openspec/changes/add-missing-features (item 3.5)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
